# SDLC

- Non-trivial work: plan → implement → review/secure → verify (see `docs/workflow.md` and `AGENTS.md`).
- Prefer the smallest change that satisfies the approved plan.
- Every behavior change needs a matching test, or an explicit note: `no test because: …`.
- Update docs only when user-facing behavior or public API/contracts change.
- Before claiming merge-ready: run stack checks and use `verifier` / `ship-checklist` when appropriate.
- Capture recurring agent mistakes as new focused rules later — do not grow this file into a novel.
